cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NESS in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "NESS: a composable research platform for neural-symbolic-probabilistic predictive systems"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-09-26
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/guilamacie/NESS"
url: "https://github.com/guilamacie/NESS"
abstract: >-
  NESS implements the Neural-Symbolic Sandwich architecture as a plugin platform: frozen
  substrates, trainable upper modules, semantic adapters, typed symbolic programs, exact and
  sampled probabilistic reasoners, pinned analogue memory and caps, composed by configuration
  into a validated macro graph, learned through a NESS JAX backend or the FabricPC 0.6
  predictive-coding backend, and checkpointed and restored as one system.
authors:
  - name: "NESS research programme"
  - name: "guilamacie"
keywords:
  - neuro-symbolic
  - predictive coding
  - FabricPC
  - JAX
  - composable architecture
